msgid ""
"Official setup information can be found `here "
"<http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__ but the short form "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"官方设置说明可在 `此处 <http://docs.openmv.io/openmvcam/tutorial/index.html>`__ "
"找到，简要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:41
#: 77f23f6def0e4835b9370702c2371ca5 978830d50a684933864e178d979797e5
#: db13d586f8ae488e80907a81030289a0 eb5f1e60142c4afc9e3b79b65f219799
msgid ""
"Connect the OpenMV camera to your computer.  On Windows the camera should "
"appear as a new COM port and a virtual drive should also be created (this is"
" where scripts are copied to below)"
msgstr "将 OpenMV 摄像头连接到计算机。在 Windows 上，摄像头应显示为新的 COM 端口，并创建一个虚拟驱动器（脚本就复制到这里）。"

