"A green light on the camera should begin flashing which shows the script is "
"running"
msgstr "摄像头上的绿色灯应开始闪烁，表示脚本正在运行"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:54
#: 2816bb6b2bbe46f2a0917b9cca094f25 3ebb71c0fbfd4e7db5310c77895b11fa
#: 886edd9e0965482d85ee836a9047da50 e0189ef42deb4f67b9bb06bbfd59a1f5
msgid "Additional Notes"
msgstr "附加说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:56
#: 52318b2520bf4a56955c3f3c743d7385 5a32cb4b73c84183a4ca2f9392265f5a
#: 8b1d9ec179824307a905dbefab06f017 df717200a95d4c789799dcd474aa0367
msgid ""
"As with the :ref:`PX4Flow sensor <common-px4flow-overview>` a range finder "
"is required to use the sensor for autonomous modes including :ref:`Loiter "
"<loiter-mode>` and :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`"
msgstr ""
"与 :ref:`PX4Flow 传感器 <common-px4flow-overview>` 一样，在 Loiter 和 RTL "
"等自主模式中使用该传感器需要配备测距仪（:ref:`Loiter <loiter-mode>` 和 :ref:`RTL <rtl-mode>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:57
#: 469d04d1b4054168a77a8412758631f0 76c47292d9f4478ab694259ef8dc6427
#: 7b4ff21b35c64537949fb1a215f71863 86f52de156564710a3f83bd05649bf28
msgid ""
":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` does not require the use of a rangefinder"
msgstr ":ref:`FlowHold <flowhold-mode>` 模式无需使用测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:58
#: 249c952729064365b19bd7769d465439 7542ec93101245ed81ad1e2c9ccb09d5
#: a2fa93edb0274699b63e6942a4c1bdad eabc7be9c0214debad5a7dffbddd06c7
msgid "The sensor has been successfully tested to altitudes of about 10m"
msgstr "该传感器已成功在约 10m 高度以下测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:59
#: 1d268318f6c84062ac205b6a80bbba90 8760089daf4c45408701df9061046468
#: b56fe102f7154e0cbcb3cb655acb3021 deb2a8228d374ed3a3dfe7dc75c1d527
msgid ""
"Performance can be improved by setting the :ref:`sensors position parameters"
" <common-sensor-offset-compensation>`.  For example if the sensor is mounted"
" 2cm forward and 5cm below the frame's center of rotation set "
":ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` to 0.02 and :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` to"
" 0.05."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 :ref:`传感器位置参数 <common-sensor-offset-compensation>` "
"可以提升性能。例如，若传感器安装在机架旋转中心前方 2cm、下方 5cm 处，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_X <FLOW_POS_X>` 设为 "
"0.02，将 :ref:`FLOW_POS_Z <FLOW_POS_Z>` 设为 0.05。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:62
#: 235de33f4cec4037ab8d59e8d5a4dc7c 60bd7c92e5024c85993c791a2d70d642
#: 70a1103af15b444a9730d367a6c6fb4c bf7f8bac45184ade8803df59fca1024a
msgid "Testing and Setup"
msgstr "测试与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:64
#: 29f1d55019014e24ab140cd8f13dad2d 4cc1edf5a00d463690c5c1d70c7018c4
#: 9e93ab51146c4c89a20674854bf943b1 e0bd1580dc0b488b8ee15f7ccf72f2de
msgid "See :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` for setup guides."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`common-optical-flow-sensor-setup` 了解设置指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-openmv-optflow.rst:65
#: 06488cc3f9d44ae3b1a919a81bc92568 16e79eeaf10548e6b808e4ce0d5bb0ea
#: a79d037f85394ab885124183f63940bc c94377b8d2fd4bc793c9f511ddb4d960
msgid ""
"Note that recommended value for :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` or "
":ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY <EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` for this sensor is 80."
msgstr ""
"请注意，此传感器 :ref:`EK2_FLOW_DELAY <EK2_FLOW_DELAY>` 或 :ref:`EK3_FLOW_DELAY "
"<EK3_FLOW_DELAY>` 的推荐值为 80。"
